# Auto commit and push

After every completed code change in this project, commit to `main` and `git push origin main` without waiting for the user to ask.

- Follow the existing commit-message style (English, one sentence, focus on why).
- Do not skip hooks, force-push, or amend unless the user explicitly asks.
- Do not wait for a second "pusha" in this repo.
